    "summary": "For a **TRANSCENDENT C'TAN** model. In your turn, each time the bearer's unit uses its **Transdimensional Displacement** ability to make an **ingress/advance move**:\n\n- It may finish that move over 6\" horizontally away from every enemy unit, rather than over 8\".\n- If it finishes that move 8\" or closer to an enemy unit, it cannot declare a charge for the rest of the turn.\n\nOnly the Advance part applies at present, because Transdimensional Displacement grants only an Advance.",
